    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42111" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Săbārĭa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Săvā-</span></b> ), ae, f.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in
				Pannonia</i>, <i>a colony of the emperor
			Claudius</i>, <i>hence called Sabaria Claudia</i>,
			now <i>Szombathely</i>, <i><span class="en">Aur.
				Vict. Epit. 19, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Colonia divi Claudii Sabaria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					3, 24, 27, § 146</span></i>
			.</div>
